Description: 4k intro for Linux by the old dude, released in 2011
 Teh 4k 3000 is a 4k intro released by the old dude at Instanssi 2011,
 where it ended 3rd in the combined 4k competition. It was the first demo
 of its author: a software synthesizer, one synth riff and a triangle.
 .
 The intro uses OpenGL and SDL 1.2. This package contains the bigger
 executable released next to the packed 4k version.
